Package: rockchip-mpp-dev
Version: @VERSION@
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Multi-Arch: same
Maintainer: rk-builder maintainers <whoarei@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17), libstdc++6
Homepage: https://github.com/rockchip-linux/mpp
Description: Rockchip MPP hardware media codec library and development files
 MPP (Media Process Platform) is the Rockchip hardware video encoder/decoder
 userspace library. This package contains the aarch64 shared library, API
 headers and pkg-config file cross-compiled from rockchip-linux/mpp.
